  "tha-ap246:1.2": "niyyāti lokanāyako / ",
  "tha-ap246:1.3": "viravapupphaṃ paggayha ",
  "tha-ap246:1.4": "Buddhassa abhiropayiṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap246:2.1": "Ekanavute ito kappe ",
  "tha-ap246:2.2": "yaṃ puppham abhipūjayiṃ / ",
  "tha-ap246:2.3": "duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi ",
  "tha-ap246:2.4": "Buddhapūjāy' idaṃ phalaṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap246:3.1": "Paṭisambhidā . . . ",
  "tha-ap246:3.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap246:3.3": "pe . . . // // ",
  "tha-ap246:4.1": "Itthaṃ sudam āyasmā Viravapupphiyo thero i. g. a-ti. Viravapupphiyattherassa ",
  "tha-ap246:5.1": "apadānaṃ samattaṃ. "
